---
title: Preview handoffs · front-door claim, then product sign-in
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant tab as Session tab
  participant page as Preview tab
  participant door as Vercel front door
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant app as Client product

  Note over tab,cp: Front-door claim · admits the browser to the session origin
  tab->>cp: POST /v1/sessions/{session_id}/preview-handoff
  Note over cp: Refuses unless a committed<br/>route for the session is ready.
  cp-->>tab: claim URL on the session origin
  tab->>page: open the claim URL
  page->>door: claim URL · one-time code
  door->>cp: POST /v1/preview/handoffs/{code}/exchange
  cp-->>door: origin-bound session credential
  door-->>page: session cookie · redirect to /__utrace/sign-in
  Note over page,app: Product handoff · signs the participant into the client application
  page->>door: GET /__utrace/sign-in
  door->>cp: POST /v1/preview/routes/{host}/product-sign-in
  cp-->>door: short-lived signed token
  door->>app: post the token to the template's sign-in endpoint
  app-->>door: product session cookie + landing location
  door-->>page: product cookie + allocation cookie · redirect
